  "summaries": {
    "github:1339316901:root": {
      "text": "为 DSH 提供持久化项目记忆，索引文档与代码符号，关联任务和文件，并按需召回带出处的经验。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/00080000/dsh-project-memory/blob/fe7ac6cab91784a34996aede007d3586f0ff2def/README.md",
      "revision": "fe7ac6cab91784a34996aede007d3586f0ff2def"
    },
    "github:1333328839:root": {
      "text": "为 DSH Web 状态栏提供阶段文案、打字机、渐变、弹幕和主题，支持在设置页自定义。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/01Virex/dsh-status-rotator/blob/bf980a6d6c9dd1fce87cb9b1611cf5d42f5c10e1/README.md",
      "revision": "bf980a6d6c9dd1fce87cb9b1611cf5d42f5c10e1"
    },
    "github:1416699252:root": {
      "text": "自托管企业 AI 资源管理平台，统一纳管 MCP、Skill、Agent 和应用，提供身份、权限、计量与审计。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/01men/ybkkasi/blob/03f74c847c8af9189ce37a73321a730ceb353f2a/README.md",
      "revision": "03f74c847c8af9189ce37a73321a730ceb353f2a"
    },
    "github:1334899834:root": {
      "text": "在 DSH Web 输入区实时显示 DeepSeek API 账户余额，支持自动轮询、手动刷新和自定义刷新间隔。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/02Muller25/dsh-api-balance/blob/c27c8b61acf97714ab08d99f97b7be3a9007e52e/README.md",
      "revision": "c27c8b61acf97714ab08d99f97b7be3a9007e52e"
    },
    "github:1333368566:root": {
      "text": "在 DSH 遥测副本导出前遮盖支持的敏感键和凭证模式，保留原始会话日志。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/030611/dsh-telemetry-redactor/blob/811b0b1abf424e57045ab5a5eaa203660ca43908/README.md",
      "revision": "811b0b1abf424e57045ab5a5eaa203660ca43908"
    },
    "github:1333370288:root": {
      "text": "在每轮会话结束后生成隐私最小化的工具活动与验证信号摘要，并保存为本地 JSONL 收据。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/030611/dsh-verification-receipt/blob/87f3fb0198090f0f26a37a52840db150609db748/README.md",
      "revision": "87f3fb0198090f0f26a37a52840db150609db748"
    },
    "github:1333357514:root": {
      "text": "被动观察 DSH 会话事件与工具结果，将内容摘要写入本地哈希链收据，供后续核对。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/030611/qiushi-dsh-evidence-audit/blob/94fae130b2845309e1dcabac14696fddb18f8f3a/README.md",
      "revision": "94fae130b2845309e1dcabac14696fddb18f8f3a"
    },
    "github:1342915339:root": {
      "text": "将 DSH 的粗粒度交互状态推送到本机 Discord Rich Presence，支持自定义文案与可选丰富状态。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/0QwQ0/dsh-discord-richpresence/blob/bf8d34b4a4c52e9128a44ca7abf6a7de52880266/README.md",
      "revision": "bf8d34b4a4c52e9128a44ca7abf6a7de52880266"
    },
    "github:1343420855:root": {
      "text": "为 DSH Web 提供登录、用户管理、会话隔离与按用户模型凭证管理，支持 TOTP 和通行密钥。",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/0QwQ0/dsh-ui-auth/blob/6c5e87b44be4e973b092910968001916bb97d22e/README.md",
      "revision": "6c5e87b44be4e973b092910968001916bb97d22e"
    },
    "github:1339803365:root": {
      "text": "为 DSH 工作区与会话补充右键、双击菜单，集中提供置顶、重命名、归档、分叉和打开目录等操作。",
